+# Bug Fix: Product review privacy, validation, authorization, and rating integrity
+
+- **Slug**: ticket
+- **Fixed**: 2026-11-18T00:00:00+00:00
+- **Assessment**: ./assessment.md
+- **Status**: applied
+
+## Summary
+
+Product reviews now expose only id, rating, description, date, and a first-name-only reviewer object publicly; validate whole-number ratings from 1 through 5; enforce duplicate and authenticated-customer checks; and scope merchant mutations to the requested product. Product review aggregates are recalculated after create, update, and delete with one-decimal half-up rounding.
+
+## Changes
+
+| File | Change | Notes |
+|------|--------|-------|
+| `sm-shop-model/src/main/java/com/salesmanager/shop/model/catalog/product/ReadableProductReviewCustomer.java` | added | First-name-only public reviewer DTO. |
+| `sm-shop-model/src/main/java/com/salesmanager/shop/model/catalog/product/ReadableProductReview.java` | modified | Uses the restricted reviewer DTO. |
+| `sm-shop-model/src/main/java/com/salesmanager/shop/model/catalog/product/ProductReviewEntity.java` | modified | Adds integral rating validation. |
+| `sm-shop-model/src/main/java/com/salesmanager/shop/model/catalog/product/PersistableProductReview.java` | modified | Allows merchant updates without requiring customer id in the request body. |
+| `sm-shop/src/main/java/com/salesmanager/shop/populator/catalog/ReadableProductReviewPopulator.java` | modified | Copies only the reviewer's billing first name. |
+| `sm-shop/src/main/java/com/salesmanager/shop/store/api/v1/product/ProductReviewApi.java` | modified | Returns 400/403/409/404 for the specified cases and preserves product-scoped updates. |
+| `sm-shop/src/main/java/com/salesmanager/shop/store/facade/product/ProductCommonFacadeImpl.java` | modified | Loads existing reviews for updates. |
+| `sm-core/src/main/java/com/salesmanager/core/business/services/catalog/product/review/ProductReviewServiceImpl.java` | modified | Recomputes aggregates after every mutation and safely resolves missing reviews. |
+| `sm-shop/src/main/java/com/salesmanager/shop/mapper/catalog/product/ReadableProductMapper.java` | modified | Uses one-decimal half-up product rating output. |
+
+## Tests Added or Updated
+
+- No dedicated review test was added; the existing integration test class was used for the available regression run, but its review test is pre-existing and ignored.
+
+## Local Verification
+
+- Commands run: `git diff --check` → passed.
+- Commands run: `mvn -pl sm-core,sm-shop,sm-shop-model -am -DskipTests compile` → passed for all six reactor modules.
+- Commands run: `mvn -pl sm-shop -DskipTests=false -Dtest=ProductManagementAPIIntegrationTest test` → could not resolve released inter-module artifacts without the reactor; dependency resolution failed against an authenticated Spring repository.
+- Commands run: `mvn -pl sm-shop -am -DskipTests=false -Dtest=ProductManagementAPIIntegrationTest -Dsurefire.failIfNoSpecifiedTests=false test` → passed; 7 tests run, 6 skipped.
+
+## Deviations from Assessment
+
+The assessment proposed adding focused API tests; none were added because the existing review integration test is ignored and no dedicated review fixture/test harness was available. The implementation otherwise follows the preferred remediation.
+
+## Follow-ups
+
+- Add non-ignored API integration coverage for the status-code, privacy, and aggregate scenarios in an environment with a documented review fixture.
+- Consider a data repair for products whose stored aggregates were stale before this fix.
